            <ArticleTitle>Right internal mammary artery graft angioplasty through a right brachial artery approach using a new custom guide catheter: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>42-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Angioplasty of right internal mammary artery grafts may present problems because of the variable origin of the mammary artery and its angulation from the subclavian artery. We report a case of successful angioplasty using a custom designed guide catheter, after failed attempts using conventional guide catheters.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
